<title>GHANA: SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT LIBERIA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT LIBERIA 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia beat Liberia 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) on Sunday in their African zone group two World Cup soccer</p>
<p>qualifier.</p>
<p>Scorer:</p>
<p>Jelassi Riadh 88</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
</text>
